Z||000026||grgoyl86||09-10-2001||09:42 AM||||Thanks for the nice comments. The majority of the interior is Mr. Mike's stuff. The shifter boot came from Rodney Dickman. I don't think these pictures do it justice, I think it looks MUCH better in person.<P>BTW, anyone know any way of changing the seatbelts? I want real black webbing. I colored mine, but I would really prefer something better. I had a guy who thought he could do it, but says these retractors are almost impossible to disassemble. Most people won't even talk about - they are afraid of liability issues.<P>Thanks!||||reg||6
Z||000027||Fie Ro||09-10-2001||10:34 AM||||I have them too! Great quality and crashproof. Here they are in my 86GT<P> <IMG SRC="http://members.nbci.com/rick71/images/seats/mikes.jpg">  <P>Have a look at those aluminium plates also ;-)<P> <IMG SRC="http://members.nbci.com/rick71/images/plates/topL.jpg">  <P>After my 86GT crashed I could restore the seats and put them in my 87GT. Here covering my second soundsystem (When I get bored of my open exhaust after some hours! ;-)<P> <IMG SRC="http://members.nbci.com/rick71/images/87/87int/subpanel.jpg">  <P>subwoofer is covered by a grill now...<BR>nice and clean system<P>------------------<BR>-The Beauty & The Beast-<BR>1987 Pontiac Fiero GT & <BR>1977 Dodge W200||||reg||1
Z||000028||Fie Ro||09-10-2001||10:40 AM||||I have them too! Great quality and crashproof. Here they are in my 86GT<P> <IMG SRC="http://members.nbci.com/rick71/images/seats/mikes.jpg">  <P>Have a look at those aluminium plates also ;-)<P> <IMG SRC="http://members.nbci.com/rick71/images/plates/topL.jpg">  <P>After my 86GT crashed I could restore the seats and put them in my 87GT. Here covering my second soundsystem (When I get bored of my open exhaust after some hours! ;-)<P> <IMG SRC="http://members.nbci.com/rick71/images/87/87int/subpanel.jpg">  <P>subwoofer is covered by a grill now...<BR>nice and clean system<P>------------------<BR>-The Beauty & The Beast-<BR>1987 Pontiac Fiero GT & <BR>1977 Dodge W200||||reg||1
